    "title": "Middleware and request security",
    "description": "The load-bearing middleware chain — recover, request id, access log, locale, maintenance mode, rate limit, secure headers, session load, CSRF — and the route-group guards. The CSRF step publishes the token twice: as the inherited request header htmx reads, and into the request context that ui.Form draws its hidden field from, so a form submitted with no JavaScript is accepted.",
